* ============================================================================
* 19_substance_lr_reversal.do — P3 paper-specific long-run ROA reversal检验
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* Plan: §5.5.2 P3 extras + W&Z 1994 ASQ long-run reversal mechanism
*
* W&Z 1994 预测 (焦点假设):
*   symbolic fintech 宣告 (substantiveness 低) → 短期 CAR 正反应 →
*   3 年后 ROA 反转 (negative long_run_roa_change_3yr).
*
* 检验结构:
*   (1) 基准: long_run_roa_change_3yr ~ substantiveness + controls
*   (2) 交互项检验: long_run_roa_change ~ subst × short_run_car
*       (注 2026-06-12: 下方代码实际实现为双向交互, 未含 × post 三重差分项;
*       eststo 名 triple_diff 沿用历史命名, 勿按名理解为三重差分)
*   (3) 按短期 CAR 五分位:
*       高 CAR 子样本内, 低实质性 → 反转最强。
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767
set linesize 120

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* (1) 基准长期反转回归
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
eststo baseline

* (2) 交互项检验: subst × short_run_CAR (实际为双向交互, 见文件头注; eststo 名 triple_diff 为历史命名)
* 白话: 看"实质性低、但短期股价反应大"的宣告, 是否在 3 年后业绩跌得最狠。
* fix(omni-g-templates-06, 2026-06-11): 旧 36 字符名 car_3day_window_fintech_announcement
* 超 Stata 32 字符硬限 (r(198)) → confirm 永假, triple-diff 永不可达; 全链统一短名。
capture confirm variable car_3day_window_ft_announce
if !_rc {
    gen subst_x_car  = {{MAIN_TREAT}} * car_3day_window_ft_announce
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} car_3day_window_ft_announce subst_x_car $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo triple_diff
}
else {
    display "  [WARN] car_3day_window_ft_announce not in panel (M0.5.11 enrichment pending)"
}

* (3) 按短期 CAR 五分位分组
capture confirm variable car_3day_window_ft_announce
if !_rc {
    * fix(omni-g-templates-02, 2026-06-11): 五分位改按年内切 (by-year xtile)。旧版
    * pooled 全样本切分位: 全量 T=19 下事件 CAR 分布随市场周期漂移 → 分位组混入
    * 年代效应, 且阈值含未来年份 (in-sample 前视泄漏)。
    gen car_q = .
    quietly levelsof year, local(_carq_yrs)
    foreach y of local _carq_yrs {
        capture xtile _carq_tmp = car_3day_window_ft_announce if year == `y', n(5)
        if !_rc {
            replace car_q = _carq_tmp if year == `y'
            drop _carq_tmp
        }
        else {
            capture drop _carq_tmp
            display "  [SKIP] year `y': within-year CAR quintile 切分失败 (单元过小)"
        }
    }
    forval q = 1/5 {
        count if car_q == `q' & !missing({{MAIN_TREAT}}, {{MAIN_DV}})
        if r(N) >= 10 {
            reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls if car_q == `q', ///
                absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
            eststo car_q_`q'
        }
        else {
            display "  [SKIP] car_q=`q' has " r(N) " obs (< 10; R7-m01)"
        }
    }
}

* fix(omni-g-templates-07, 2026-06-11): esttab 名单动态化 — triple_diff/car_q_* 被
* 守卫跳过后旧版硬点名 → r(111) 丢整表 (baseline 实际可估也一并丢)。
qui estimates dir
local models `r(names)'
esttab `models' ///
    using "$tables_dir/table_lr_reversal.tex", replace ///
    star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
    title("P3 Long-Run ROA Reversal (W&Z 1994 焦点检验)") ///
    addnotes("Focal hypothesis: high short-run CAR + low substantiveness → strongest long-run ROA reversal." ///
             "CAR quintiles computed within year (by-year xtile) to avoid cohort confounding.")

display "[OK] 19_substance_lr_reversal → $tables_dir/table_lr_reversal.tex"
